"]},"author_id":"1999693479178567681","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:46:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109883578524094850"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HItODXU4bn","end":189,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ZoXinkun2O26/status/2109883578524094850/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109883571544748032","start":166,"url":"https://t.co/HItODXU4bn"}]},"id":"2109883578524094850","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股上演大奇迹日！\n\n早盘创业板跌超3%，随后三大指数集体翻红，市场来了个大反转。\n\n资金也在快速进场，多只宽基ETF成交额已超过昨日全天：\n\n-创业板ETF易方达：超66亿元\n-A500ETF南方：超34亿元\n-沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞：33亿元\n-中证1000ETF南方：近30亿元\n\n感谢神秘大哥出手，\n关键时刻稳住了市场。 https://t.co/HItODXU4bn","url":"https://x.com/ZoXinkun2O26/status/2109883578524094850"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110010407704494081"]},"author_id":"1954164308537118720","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:10:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110010414633476478"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Oq44B0LIZz","end":147,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Not691209983377/status/2110010414633476478/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110010407704494081","start":124,"url":"https://t.co/Oq44B0LIZz"}]},"id":"2110010414633476478","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":258,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"晚上好！今天有点事情更新晚了点。\n【10月13日复盘 | 探底回升收复3800，尾盘我接了星宸科技】\n一、今日盘面\n沪指涨0.10%报3800.86点，深证成指跌0.25%，创业板指跌0.18%。早盘三大指数低开，双创一度跌超3%，午后集体翻红。 https://t.co/Oq44B0LIZz","url":"https://x.com/Not691209983377/status/2110010414633476478"},{"author_id":"1954164308537118720","created_at":"2026-10-12T10:55:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109598916773896528"],"id":"2109598916773896528","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":202,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10月12日A股：主打精神分裂\n今天A股，沪指负责体面，深创负责火化。\n沪指跌0.43%，失守3800点，但银行大哥把面子焊死：中行、工行、中信盘中又创历史新高。\n深成指跌2.03%，创业板跌2.61%，科技股直接进ICU：光通信、PCB、CPO集体扑街，通信跌4.49%，电子净流出81.68亿。","url":"https://x.com/Not691209983377/status/2109598916773896528"},{"author_id":"852245268389126144","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:19:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109906897730195873"],"id":"2109906897730195873","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1014,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"技术面上，沪指今天收在3819点，站上了短期均线，但上方3850到3900点这个区间压力不小，那是之前的密集成交区，套牢盘不少。创业板指收在2993点，离3000点整数关口就差一点点，这个位置突破需要量能配合。","url":"https://x.com/Jwaher49783608/status/2109906897730195873"},{"author_id":"1996551578187436033","created_at":"2026-10-12T04:21:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109499743969906825"],"id":"2109499743969906825","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":583,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📊 开盘速报 | 10/12 集体低开后分化：沪指低开0.18%跌幅收窄，创业板半日跌1.27%失血\n\n▪️ 三大指数\n- 沪指低开0.18%报3806.98，盘中一度接近平盘（银行拉权重托底），午间收跌0.12%几乎没跌\n- 深成指低开0.43%报12586.96，低开低走，午间跌1.03%\n-","url":"https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2109499743969906825"},{"author_id":"1996551578187436033","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:58:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109539201226326275"],"id":"2109539201226326275","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1538,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"午后加速下台阶：沪指-0.46%、创业板-2.59%领跌，科技硬件遭主力砍仓\n\n▪️ 午后指数变动","url":"https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2109539201226326275"},{"author_id":"1996551578187436033","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:30:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109909701148176648"],"id":"2109909701148176648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":502,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"深V反抽收红：沪指+0.10%收复3800，创业板从盘中-3.5%捞回-0.18%\n\n▪️ 午后指数变动","url":"https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2109909701148176648"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:09:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109874128866181219"],"id":"2109874128866181219","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":373,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股的天塌了\n\n沪深两市成交额只有1.54万亿，比上一个交易日直接缩量了3600多亿。\n\n全市场超过4300只个股下跌，创业板指跌了2.61%，深证成指跌了2.03%。但是，上证指数只跌了0.43%。\n\n沪强深弱，非常明显。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2109874128866181219"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109550002318299136"]},"author_id":"1266655355565518848","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:41:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109550005833122198"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IbkiHZ2BBb","end":176,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/leoc2307/status/2109550005833122198/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109550002318299136","start":153,"url":"https://t.co/IbkiHZ2BBb"}]},"id":"2109550005833122198","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"量能缩到1.55万亿，普跌里赚钱效应基本熄火。\n\n沪深京成交额 1.55万亿（缩量3659亿）\n上证 -0.43%｜深成 -2.03%｜创业板 -2.61%｜科创50 -2.10%\n上涨1131 / 下跌4166｜涨停46 / 跌停19\n领涨：影视院线、风电设备、传媒\n领跌：贵金属、房地产服务、能源金属 https://t.co/IbkiHZ2BBb","url":"https://x.com/leoc2307/status/2109550005833122198"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109982288561975296"]},"author_id":"2095194257904844800","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:19:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109982301144916183"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HRvnjFpjJr","end":174,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ManQinHelper/status/2109982301144916183/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109982288561975296","start":151,"url":"https://t.co/HRvnjFpjJr"}]},"id":"2109982301144916183","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":440,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"创业板今天最可惜的，就是离3000点只差了0.24点。\n\n早盘一路杀到2860点，午后突然拉升，最高摸到2999.76点，结果临门一脚没过去，最后收在2958点。\n\n这个走势其实透露出一个问题：低位有人抄底，但涨上去也有人急着卖。\n\n尤其是午后那波快速拉升，明显带动了市场情绪，可惜后续资金没能接上。 https://t.co/HRvnjFpjJr","url":"https://x.com/ManQinHelper/status/2109982301144916183"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109910401211375616"]},"author_id":"12666553555655188